{"meta":{"ph":"sɪnˈsɪəli; NAmE sɪnˈsɪrli","pos":"adv.","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"in a way that shows what you really feel or think about sb/sth 真诚地；诚实地","ex":[{"s":"Yours sincerely, Jane Brown Woods High School 1 What is the topic of each paragraph?","src":"外研社B4 U4","cat":"waiyan","t":"简・布朗・伍兹高中一号 每一段的主题是什么?"},{"s":"Thank you for your time and consideration.Yours sincerely, Josie DavisYours sincerely, Josie Davisn letter.","src":"外研社B7 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"谢谢你的时间和考虑 你真诚的 乔西・戴维斯"},{"s":"Yours sincerely, Josie Davis Yours sincerely, Josie Davis find out how qualified the applicant is for the job.] Local Tour Guide Wanted Part time • 9 am to 4 pm four days a week.","src":"外研社B7 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"谨上，乔西·戴维斯 谨上，乔西·戴维斯 弄清申请者多胜任工作。] 本地导游招聘 兼职 • 每周四天早9点至下午4点。"},{"s":"Sincerely, Loving Father Dear Talking Teens, My daughter wants to study abroad but I think she is too young.","src":"人教B1 U5","cat":"renjiao","t":"真诚的,亲爱的父亲 说话的少年, 我女儿想留学, 但我认为她太年轻。"},{"s":"Sincerely yours, Zhang Yi (father of one boy) STUDYING ABROAD: IS IT A GOOD OR A BAD IDEA?","src":"人教选必2 U2","cat":"renjiao","t":"忠诚的你,张仪(一个男孩的父亲) 坚持阿波罗:这是好还是坏的想法?"}]}]}